<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Medical Manager Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Medical Manager Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Medical Manager Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			MMGR.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 5.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    18,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Donald Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  750,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Founded in July 1996 as a provider of comprehensive physician practice management systems.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Pay cash portion of purchase price for founding companies and working capital and general corporate purposes including future acquisitions.</p>
<p>Note: The company will acquire the five founding companies simultaneously with and as a condition of the consummation of this offering.</p>
</text>
